    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_02",
      "hash64": "FD55985EBA6B173A",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Oh! Why, hello there, young\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_03",
      "hash64": "FD55995EBA6B18ED",
      "text": "I’m sorry. I was lost in thought and didn’t notice\\nyour approach.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_04",
      "hash64": "FD55925EBA6B0D08",
      "text": "I feel I must again apologize for what transpired\\nin the schoolyard...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_select_01",
      "hash64": "919C6BF04B41CC5E",
      "text": "It didn’t bother me",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_select_02",
      "hash64": "919C6AF04B41CAAB",
      "text": "What’re you talking about?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_05a",
      "hash64": "E37843F6C3EA3C6E",
      "text": "Hah... That is very magnanimous of you.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_05b",
      "hash64": "E37842F6C3EA3ABB",
      "text": "I’m of course referring to how I rather suddenly\\nhad to take my leave while we were still engaged\\r\\nin conversation.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_06",
      "hash64": "FD55945EBA6B106E",
      "text": "That woman who showed up is a Dragon Tamer—\\nand a relative of mine, I might add.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_08",
      "hash64": "FD558E5EBA6B063C",
      "text": "You see, I come from a very long line of Trainers\\nwho specialize in Dragon-type Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_09",
      "hash64": "FD558F5EBA6B07EF",
      "text": "There was a child in our family who was expected\\nto stand at its head and lead it to greatness.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_10",
      "hash64": "FD591C5EBA6E2D5D",
      "text": "But the young lad, rebellious little fellow that he\\nwas, ran away from home one day.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_11",
      "hash64": "FD591B5EBA6E2BAA",
      "text": "He made quite the show of it, too, swearing he’d\\n“make a living with music”![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_12",
      "hash64": "FD591A5EBA6E29F7",
      "text": "A lot happened since then, and...now he’s the art\\nteacher and Elite Four member before you![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_13",
      "hash64": "FD59195EBA6E2844",
      "text": "After I so rudely took my leave during our last\\nconversation, my dear relative...encouraged me\\r\\nto give up teaching and return home at last.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_14",
      "hash64": "FD59185EBA6E2691",
      "text": "I’ve been told the current leader of my family—\\nthat is to say, my father—is in poor health.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_15",
      "hash64": "FD59175EBA6E24DE",
      "text": "Oh, but I do apologize. Perhaps I am not cut out\\nfor teaching after all... What sort of teacher\\r\\ngrumbles on and on at his own student?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_select_03",
      "hash64": "919C69F04B41C8F8",
      "text": "You’re a great teacher!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_select_04",
      "hash64": "919C70F04B41D4DD",
      "text": "I don’t want you to quit teaching!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_dragon_c_16",
      "hash64": "FD59165EBA6E232B",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Ah, my dear [VAR 0x0100(0000)]... You\\nhave\\r\\nno\\r\\nidea\\r\\nhow\\r\\nmuch\\r\\nyour\\r\\nwords\\r\\nmean\\r\\nto me.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
